Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:54.69,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\bord3\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs120\fsp20\frz270\c&H221E25&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1721,458)}好氣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:14.11,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(460,0)\bord5\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs60\frz288.4\c&HF154AD&\3c&H5A2B4E&\pos(658,76)}我沒有\N　叫你來啊
