Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:22.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(460,0)\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs60\frz260.5\c&H56412A&\pos(1813,80)}零食你就\N　隨便吃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:51.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs80\frz354.1\c&H373331&\3c&HF1F0F0&\pos(486,572)}樂於助人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:07.48,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs60\frz263.6\c&H575D44&\pos(1035,296)}你認真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:32.71,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs90\fsp5\frz286.2\c&H2D2E30&\3c&HE3EEF0&\move(247,602,247,855)}喂\N{\fscx40}　{\fscx100}信號燈\N{\fscx70}　{\fscx100}變紅了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs80\frz282\c&H3F5449&\3c&HBDF0D5&\move(1586,459,1986,459)}小美胡\N{\fscx100}　{\fscx100}歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs80\frz279.3\c&H3F5449&\3c&HBDF0D5&\move(571,474,971,474)}我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:36.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs80\frz271.1\c&H4C4B57&\3c&HCECFE1&\move(60,488,425,488)}小千鶴\N{\fscx70}　{\fscx100}要好好\N{\fscx140}　{\fscx100}補充水分喔
